    "weakest_point": "The middle section (3s–23s) is talk-heavy setup about the disguise; a scroller who stayed for the opening line might drift before the door opens.",
    "hook": {
      "score": 4,
      "reason": "At 0.1s a close-up of Lady Juliana delivers the shocking line \"The Duchess is dying\" with fierce conviction. It promises life-or-death stakes instantly, though it is a line rather than an on-screen action like a slap or explosion."
    },
    "cliffhanger": {
      "score": 5,
      "reason": "It cuts at the exact peak: the Dowager Duchess violently convulses, choking with terrified eyes, as Lady Juliana demands \"Who has been treating you?\" and the music hits on the poison revelation. The question of who is poisoning her is left burning and unanswered."
    },
    "questions": [
      {"q": "Who is poisoning the Duchess?", "type": "intrigue"},
      {"q": "Will Lady Juliana be discovered as a lady?", "type": "intrigue"},
      {"q": "Why is Juliana risking everything to save the Duchess?", "type": "intrigue"}
    ],
    "standalone": {
      "score": 4,
      "reason": "With zero context you understand a noblewoman is disguising herself as a maid to reach a dying Duchess, and the Duchess is being poisoned. The wronged party and stakes are clear; only the poisoner's identity is unknown."
    },
    "emotion": {
      "score": 4,
      "reason": "Strong urgency and injustice. The image of the frail Duchess gasping in agony and the sudden realization of poison creates a gut-punch of fear and anger."
    },
    "want_next": {
      "score": 4,
      "reason": "The unanswered question of who is treating/poisoning the Duchess and whether Juliana's perilous disguise will hold creates a strong need to see the next episode."
    },
    "ad_policy": {
      "level": "none",
      "category": "none",
      "reason": "No on-screen violence, blood, sexual content, or gore. Only a dying woman and verbal discussion of poison."
    },
    "one_line_verdict": "Strong hook, clear stakes, and a peak-cut poison cliffhanger."
  },
  {
    "id": "C2",
    "weakest_point": "The entire clip is a calm interrogation with no high-stakes action; the tension is resolved by 34s and the ending is a transitional question.",
