  },
  {
    "id": "C3",
    "weakest_point": "It jumps straight into the bedroom without the disguise setup, so the first 3s are vague and the protagonist's motivation is unclear.",
    "hook": {
      "score": 3,
      "reason": "\"Do not stare. Keep walking\" is urgent and implies danger, but it needs a moment to land and lacks the immediate high-stakes revelation of a dying Duchess in the first 3s."
